  "scope": "scripts/qualify_runtime_plcsim_tcpip.py --mode normal on an owned PLCSIM Advanced V8 TCP/IP instance (scratch CPU 1511-1 PN at 192.168.0.1) on a build with the connect-time route gate: runtime_ua_write, runtime_web_write and runtime_web_operating_mode (RUN to STOP and back) pass with sessions connected through the PLCSIM Virtual Ethernet Adapter, their stale-precondition refusals hold, UA subscriptions with the default three keep-alives run to their duration although the server revises the publishing interval to 1000 ms, and a Web API capture stopped mid-run leaves its session usable for the following RUN/STOP; the independent oracle found no issue. 95/95 steps.",
